    "updated_at": "2016-03-04T22:07:58Z",
    "body": "@ajklein also says:\n\n> existing implementations do seem to check for the existence of a property during the loop anyway, though it'd be awesome if we didn't have to do that\n\nwhich would correspond to an additional HasProperty check before [[Get]]ing. This is observable if a getter _deletes_ a property later in enumeration order.\n\nNot sure if we should spec this given the latter comment. Maybe @ajklein was hoping to remove that from Blink?\n",
