    "body": "I have no idea if the \"don't include deleted properties\" behavior is something that the web depends upon. WebKit/Blink/Gecko don't seem to care if you _add_ a property during iteration. But I don't think it's something that we should change as part of the resolution to this issue, just because it's already interoperable.\n",
